ers in the fourth quarter and to date in the fourth -- excuse me, first quarter of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/26/vicor-corp-vicr-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VICR 2018 Q4","e":"vicr","d":"2019-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrizio Vinciarelli","x":"But when you are passing through that 1,000 amps that's 70 watts worth of heat which is a light bulb it in and of itself.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/26/vicor-corp-vicr-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"VICR 2020 Q2","e":"vicr","d":"2020-07-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Davies","x":"So it's sort of across the board, but yes, we are getting some nice bookings ramps, if you like from the data center AI guys we have been talking about and HPC companies, hyperscalers coming back to ordering what they typically awarded and they've gone through a slowdown as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/vicor-corp-vicr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"VICR 2020 Q2","e":"vicr","d":"2020-07-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Patrizio Vinciarelli","x":"But if we look at the medium to long-term, if you will, pass the next couple of quarters into, let's say, the '20 -- '22, '23 timeframe, there is a lot of action that is taking place in automotive that will bolt-on to further developments in AI and data center.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/vicor-corp-vicr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"VICR 2020 Q2","e":"vicr","d":"2020-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James A. Simms","x":"Gross margin was also burdened by higher tariff charges totaling $2 million for the period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/vicor-corp-vicr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"VICR 2020 Q2","e":"vicr","d":"2020-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James A. Simms","x":"Unfortunately, U.S. customs is yet to address our duty drawback filings, so we have yet to recover any amount of the total of $9.4 million paid in -- to-date in tariffs on Chinese imports.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/vicor-corp-vicr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"VICR 2020 Q2","e":"vicr","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrizio Vinciarelli","x":"So another example would be for components that we used to source from Japan that had moved to China because of cost reduction opportunities very soon they're going to be back in Japan because all told we can source them with lower overall costs back from Japan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/vicor-corp-vicr-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"VICR 2020 Q4","e":"vicr","d":"2021-02-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"James A. Simms","x":"…further as a percentage of total revenues, especially once new manufacturing capacity comes online, given the high-growth segments we are targeting with our 48-volt technology, including AI, data center and automotive, in contrast to the mature growth of the segments we serve with Brick Products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/vicor-corp-vicr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2020 Q4","e":"vicr","d":"2021-02-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Davies","x":"I think that the focus is going to be continued growth through data center and artificial intelligence, design-ins and wins that we've gotten as that business grows itself will grow along with it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/vicor-corp-vicr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2020 Q4","e":"vicr","d":"2021-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James A. Simms","x":"Margins remain under some pressure of high tariff charges, which totaled $1.5 million, representing approximately 1.8 margin points for the whole quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/vicor-corp-vicr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2020 Q4","e":"vicr","d":"2021-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James A. Simms","x":"We did see a reduction in quarterly tariffs as Q4's total was 18% lower sequentially, in part, reflecting our ongoing efforts to reduce component imports from China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/vicor-corp-vicr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2021 Q1","e":"vicr","d":"2021-04-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Richard J. Nagel","x":"…as a percentage of total revenues especially once new manufacturing capacity comes online, given the high-growth segments we have penetrated with our 48-volt technology, including AI, data center and automotive, in contrast to the maturity of the segments we serve with Brick Products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/vicor-corp-vicr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2021 Q1","e":"vicr","d":"2021-04-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Davies","x":"Our legacy product bookings were strong in Q1 as was our data center, supercomputer and AI customer demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/vicor-corp-vicr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2021 Q1","e":"vicr","d":"2021-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Richard J. Nagel","x":"Higher volumes and improved mix contributed to higher profitability, as did a reduction in cost variances and tariff charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/vicor-corp-vicr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2021 Q1","e":"vicr","d":"2021-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Richard J. Nagel","x":"While margins remain under the pressure of high tariff charges, the Q1 charge declined approximately 33% from Q4's charge of approximately $1.5 million.","url":"https