nd 12 volt to 48 volt bridging bus converters were robust and our visibility into production programs is longer than we have seen on previous projects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/vicor-corp-vicr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2021 Q3","e":"vicr","d":"2021-10-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Davies","x":"Next-generation AI processor and data center CPU server programs in early stages of development and pre-production will provide $70 to $150 of Vicor content per board.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/vicor-corp-vicr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2021 Q3","e":"vicr","d":"2021-10-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James F. Schmidt","x":"Margins remain under the pressure of high tariff charges though the Q3 charge was approximately the same as Q2's charge of approximately $1.9 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/vicor-corp-vicr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2021 Q3","e":"vicr","d":"2021-10-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James F. Schmidt","x":"In my prepared remarks, as we said the tariff expense in the P&L and cost of sales was $1.9 million, which is approximately what it was last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/vicor-corp-vicr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2021 Q3","e":"vicr","d":"2021-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Dillon","x":"And then along with that then, I would imagine you have pretty good pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/vicor-corp-vicr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2021 Q3","e":"vicr","d":"2021-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Dillon","x":"Are you guys raising prices?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/vicor-corp-vicr-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2025 Q2","e":"vicr","d":"2025-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jim Schmidt","x":"Tariff expense was approximately $2 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/23/vicor-vicr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2025 Q2","e":"vicr","d":"2025-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Phil Davies","x":"Our second quarter book to bill ratio came in below one, due to order cancellations from customers in China and widespread order placement hesitancy around tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/23/vicor-vicr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2025 Q2","e":"vicr","d":"2025-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Patrizio Vinciarelli","x":"It would you got the AI, the center opportunities you know, point of load as well as earlier, passing through critical hubs in the 48 volt and the diameter wall.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/23/vicor-vicr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2025 Q3","e":"vicr","d":"2025-10-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Davies","x":"My remarks this quarter are focused on data center and AI power system requirements and the market opportunity for Vicor's chips and second-generation vertical power delivery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/22/vicor-vicr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2025 Q3","e":"vicr","d":"2025-10-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Davies","x":"To support advances in AI-capable data centers and specialized AI factories, power delivery networks need to supply hundreds of kilowatts per rack and thousands of amperes for every GPU, TPU, and network processor.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/22/vicor-vicr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2025 Q3","e":"vicr","d":"2025-10-21","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Jonathan Tanwanteng","x":"Is that just the catch-up from the tariff headwind that you faced, or is there more organic demand there underlying that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/22/vicor-vicr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2026 Q1","e":"vicr","d":"2026-04-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Davies","x":"Our broad industrial market, which is supported by our global distribution partners, had a strong first quarter, and our top 100 industrial OEMs in the automated test and semiconductor manufacturing equipment markets continue to benefit from the AI data center buildout with strong order placement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/03/vicor-vicr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VICR 2026 Q2","e":"vicr","d":"2026-07-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Phil Davies","x":"AI data center hyperscalers and OEMs need Vertical Power Delivery to meet compute density requirements and AI data center performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/21/vicor-vicr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,8841,0,0,0,7291,1080],[42,1,7763,0,0,0,5615,1452],[44,1,8312,0,0,0,6399,1446],[45,1,7532,0,0,0,5880,1076],[46,1,7479,0,0,0,5399,1431],[47,1,7714,0,0,0,5775,1539],[62,1,6105,0,0,0,4111,1506],[63,1,7638,0,0,0,5579,1647],[64,1,7414,0,0,0,4864,1971],[65,1,6502,0,0,0,3769,1265],[66,1,6630,0,0,0,3157,2919]],"cinema":[[36,1,8841,0,0,0,7291,1080],[42,1,7763,0,0,0,5615,1452],[44,1,8312,0,0,0,6399,1446],[45,1,7532,0,0,0,5880,1076],[46,1,7479,0,0,0,5399,1431],[47,1,7714,0,0,0,5775,1539],[62,1,6105,0,0,0,4111,1506],[63,1,7638,0,0,0,5579,1647],[64,1,7414,0,0,0,4864,1971],[65,1,6502,0,0,0,3769,1265],[66,1,6630,0,0,0,3157,2919]],"imax":[[36,1,8841,0,0,0,7291,1080],[42,1,7763,0,0,0,5615,1452],[44,1,8312,0,0,0,6399,1446],[45,1,7532,0,0,0,5880,1076],[46,1,7479,0,0,0,5399,1431],[47,1,7714,0,0,0,5775,1539],[62,1,6105,0,0,0,4111,1506],[63,1,7638,0,0,0,5579,1647],[64,1,7414,0,0,0,4864,1971],[65,1,6502,0,0,0,3769,1265],[66,1,6630,0,0,0